                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Moxie: I will keep\nthe stop list and\nlog a missed call.\nPip will",
                                        "answer when I\nreport one. Nobody\ngets to replace\nthe word missed",
                                        "with almost. The\nroof watch\nvolunteers a dry\nshelf for the log."
                                      ],
